      "writtenOn": "2022-09-15T14:57:31Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Given the following comment in the bug:\n    \"We cannot have m update-api \u003ctarget_that_depends_on_update_api\u003e. The latter will still see the stale api.txt file\"\n\nCould you have this fail if the ninja args includes an update-api build target with a non update-api build target?",
